bad_thunk_update=∀(m :thunk_mode) (v :v) (refs :v ref sptree$num_map). bad_thunk_update m v refs ⇔ m = Evaluated ∧ (dest_thunk v refs :dest_thunk_ret) ≠ NotThunk
